  "handle": "first-ascent-mens-stretch-fit-hiking-pants-copy",
  "description": "<h3><span>Description</span></h3>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-12 product-info\">\n<div class=\"short-description\">\n<p class=\"std\"><span>Built for versatility and movement, the Men's StretchFit Zip-Off Pants combine the flexibility of StretchFit fabric with the practicality of a zip-off design. Engineered for durability and comfort, they stretch in any direction, ensuring unrestricted movement while climbing or trekking. Easily convert them into shorts or zip halfway for added ventilation. Lightweight yet tough, these pants are perfect for tackling mountains, trails, and rugged terrains.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3><span>Features</span></h3>\n<ul></ul>\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"std\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<ul>\n<li>StretchFit Enduro fabric</li>\n<li>Semi elasticated waistband</li>\n<li>Moisture management inner waistband</li>\n<li>4 Secure multipurpose storage pockets</li>\n<li>Zip-Off convertible legs</li>\n<li>UPF30+<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<h3>Specifications<br>\n</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Materials: 87% Polyester 13% Spandex<br>\n</li>\n</ul>",
